nd for an Event Task is [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]asked about once through a one-key `bob gcal ack` review queue; [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]until acked (or noted) its open row wears a hard-to-miss Bob-owned [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]warning tag, sync keeps creating rows regardless, and a weekly [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]vault chore drives the sweep.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]gcal_external_event_ack.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/gcal_external_event_ack.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-l5[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-l5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]gcal.ack journal kind, ack fold, and the external classifier[/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]journal[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]journal: add the gcal.ack record (parse, fold into an AckBook, append), [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note-history ack evidence, the load_state skip, the account guard, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reset/-F survival, model.rs is_external(), and the gcal.ack config kill [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]switch.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Unacked row tag reconciliation and sync/list surfaces[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]tag[dim] · [dim][/dim]after journal[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]tag: teach split_suffix the warning-tag marker, reconcile the tag [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]through the want/present/last table in the sync planner (including the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]delete-the-tag inferred ack), journal the additive unacked row field, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and surface warnings in sync and list human and JSON output.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The bob gcal ack command[/bold #D7AFFF]                                      [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after journal, tag[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: build the interactive one-key review queue (termios raw mode), the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]note branch through the shared note writer, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]one-shot/list/clear/dry-run/JSON forms, exit codes, the note.rs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sibling-list fix, doctor acks section, stale-seen notices, and shell [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Docs, decision record, and glossary[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: author docs/gcal-acks.md, update docs/gcal.md (commands, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]row-ownership table, JSON, known limits) and docs/gcal-notes.md [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cross-links, keep docs-gen/docs-check green, and file the decision [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]record and glossary strand through /sase_memory_write.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Weekly reminder row at rollout[/bold #D7AFFF]                                [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]vault[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]vault: after the release train ships the command, add the weekly Monday [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]ack chore row to ~/bob/gtd_daily.md and sanity-check the rollout.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-l5","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-luna","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"